Freedreno threshold review
--------------------------
At Mesa e443fef0f24 (relevant files unchanged in f0f99ecd300):
MAX_ARRAY_SIZE=65535; ringbuffer checks fail above 32767 BOs.
fd_batch_check_size polls after draw/clear and requests a flush. Final
command BOs and merging deferred submits can add entries afterwards.
No corresponding 32K command-count rule was found. This is a Mesa
implementation policy, not a kernel UAPI maximum.

